AI-Driven Accrual Matching
Planned Video Script & Flow
SLIDE 1 – Accrual Worklist (How the Solution Works)
Visual Focus

•	Open directly on the Accrual Worklist dashboard.
•	Slowly zoom into the KPI cards.
•	Scroll through the Recommended Accrual Items table.
•	Highlight the Recommended Action and Root Cause Analysis columns.
•	Pause briefly on each worklist category.
Voiceover

Every month-end, finance teams need to determine which purchase order items require accruals before the books are closed.
Traditionally, this involves manually reviewing hundreds of open transactions, validating supporting documents, and coordinating with procurement and business stakeholders. This process is time-consuming, repetitive, and often delays the financial close.
Our AI-Driven Accrual Matching solution simplifies this process by intelligently evaluating every open purchase order item using SAP transactional data, configurable business rules, and machine learning.
Based on this analysis, each transaction is automatically classified into one of four action categories:
• Auto Post Eligible
• Exception Review Queue
• Watchlist or Observation Queue
• No Action Required
Rather than reviewing every transaction individually, finance users can immediately focus on the items that genuinely require attention.
For every recommendation, the solution also provides a Root Cause Analysis explaining why the item has been categorized in a particular way. This improves transparency, supports consistent decision-making, reduces manual effort, and enhances audit readiness.
SLIDE 2 – Executive Summary (Business Overview)
Visual Focus

•	Transition to the Executive Summary dashboard.
•	Highlight each KPI card sequentially.
•	Pan across Exposure by Aging Bucket.
•	Highlight Top Vendors by Accrual Exposure.
